  "hints": [
    "Greedy largest-coin-first fails on coin sets like [1, 3, 4] for amount 6 (greedy picks 4+1+1=3 instead of 3+3=2).",
    "Use bottom-up 1D DP: dp = [amount + 1] * (amount + 1) with dp[0] = 0; for a in range(1, amount + 1): dp[a] = min(dp[a - c] + 1 for c in coins if c <= a).",
    "Pseudocode:\n  INF = amount + 1\n  dp = [INF] * (amount + 1); dp[0] = 0\n  for coin in coins:\n      for x in range(coin, amount + 1):\n          dp[x] = min(dp[x], dp[x - coin] + 1)\n  return -1 if dp[amount] >= INF else dp[amount]"
  ],
